{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/d8fa9f214ea641e9af71d3a6a5305518.avif?t=1757257602\" width=460 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixplorer\u00a0</strong>is a sandbox game with 2D graphics in a 3D voxel world. In this medieval fantasy setting, you can craft objects, build your house, fight monsters, explore the world, find dungeons, fish, capture insects, farm, mine and simply enjoy the atmosphere.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>____________</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VOXEL WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game features 2D top-down graphics, you\u2019ll explore a fully 3D voxel world, one that takes a little getting used to. Once you\u2019re comfortable with the controls and aesthetic, you\u2019ll find you can do almost anything. The world is built from block-based terrain and sprites for everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/e99dc95ca7b0cb56a436077a3b4c9816.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/e99dc95ca7b0cb56a436077a3b4c9816.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/e99dc95ca7b0cb56a436077a3b4c9816.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE THE WILDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world may seem peaceful, but don\u2019t be fooled: it\u2019s full of danger. While you can often avoid trouble, why not turn the tables and become the trouble instead? Just be careful: enemies hit hard, and you start your adventure as a fragile entity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/79eb7b554d9b89416ddae4a8c5bbb59b.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/79eb7b554d9b89416ddae4a8c5bbb59b.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/79eb7b554d9b89416ddae4a8c5bbb59b.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT HUNDREDS OF ITEMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to break a rock? Grab a pickaxe. Chopping down a tree? An axe will do. Prefer chopping down enemies instead? Choose from over 100 weapons: swords, daggers, clubs, katars, spears, hammers, and more. If melee isn\u2019t your style, try a bow with sturdy arrows, or wield a magic staff and cast your strongest spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/65df9c9827e07fde393802034320fa58.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/65df9c9827e07fde393802034320fa58.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/65df9c9827e07fde393802034320fa58.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is procedurally generated, featuring 16 unique biomes and dozens of structures to discover. Do you prefer the openness of green grasslands,  snowy landscapes, or a dark, mysterious forest ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/627639e956fb2967e06c7bd62961fd65.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/627639e956fb2967e06c7bd62961fd65.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/627639e956fb2967e06c7bd62961fd65.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOUSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a mansion block by block, add a garden, craft furniture, and place it wherever - and however - you like. Your home, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/82752762b518582b5b89da6370c39e17.avif?t=1757257602\" width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CATCH FISH AND INSECTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, catching small fish is easy, but can you catch a dragonfly? They\u2019re fast! And those little faeries? I wouldn\u2019t recommend trying to catch them... Fish and insects are everywhere. Can you catch them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/f08088b03f26df3871cb4cfcba114506.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/f08088b03f26df3871cb4cfcba114506.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/f08088b03f26df3871cb4cfcba114506.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMASS RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No great adventurer succeeds without resources. Gather, craft, and prepare to achieve  ambitious goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/182abe66076d53c3d0ca9f50dc196891.poster.avif?t=1757257602\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/182abe66076d53c3d0ca9f50dc196891.webm?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/182abe66076d53c3d0ca9f50dc196891.mp4?t=1757257602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>____________</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>_____</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966650/extras/618994eb97408cbd84063ed0f95a4a60.avif?t=1757257602\" width=72 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>... ready for an adventure ?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966650?t=1757257602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamst